WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back with two folded blankets under the shoulders, head off the blankets.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Lift the legs and hips, bringing the hands to support the lower back.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Walk the elbows in and stack hips over shoulders, legs reaching toward the sky.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the gaze soft toward the chest — do not turn the head.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
To exit, lower into Plow or roll down slowly with bent knees.
